      {
        "id": 11201,
        "name": "wisdomcube",
        "username": "wisdomcube",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/958977/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-31T17:10:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm still confused with Hazard Radius:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>So let's see we have <a href=\"http://i209.photobucket.com/albums/bb208/Piestrio/Picture1.png\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this map</a> with a Powered Auto-Turret (Hazard Attack Radius 2) on Hex 12.7 and Wraith begins her turn on 12.4. She moves from 12.4 to 12.5. Does the Auto Turret's harzad attack trigger when she moves there? This seems like a basic question but we were struggling to answer that after reading both the rules and the other Hazard thread. Please help as we really want to play and enjoy this game (and I think we will) but we're having a tough time understanding some of the rules.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:27.093Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 5,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 25.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 11199,
        "topic_slug": "hazard-radius",
        "display_username": "wisdomcube",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
